{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56606","headline":"敬和徐司马闲厅晚景之赠 · 赵志","name":"敬和徐司马闲厅晚景之赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"俄景暧余晖，寒村归栖翼。\n吏休案牍敛，庭闲谊讼息。\n顾修圬钝姿，多慙弼谐力。\n不能庶知止，方归事耕植。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56606.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56606","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}